@startuml
top to bottom direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle stickman
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 75
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

title Use Case model — generalizace interních rolí

actor "Interní uživatel" as Employee
actor "Majitel" as Owner
actor "Dělník" as Worker
actor "Řidič" as Driver
actor "Pověřený uživatel evidence" as RecordsUser #FFF4CC

Employee <|-- Owner
Employee <|-- Worker
Employee <|-- Driver
Employee <|-- RecordsUser

' Hidden links give the specialized roles a stable left-to-right order.
Owner -[hidden]right- Worker
Worker -[hidden]right- Driver
Driver -[hidden]right- RecordsUser

@enduml
